            ; the walker's element-vs-property routing, decided by the KEY
            ; TEXT (D-ARRAYSPARSE): a canonical index within the dense cap
            ; pads holes and stores; past the cap it is a property that still
            ; moves length; `length` itself resizes.
            if (pk == "length") {
