        ; to find them there.
        ; annexB B.2.2.1: `o.__proto__` IS [[GetPrototypeOf]], and writing it is
        ; [[SetPrototypeOf]] -- an accessor on Object.prototype, not a data
        ; property, which is what makes it inherited by every object and
        ; describable as a getter/setter pair.
